# Unit29
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit29核心词汇

personal/ˈpɜːrsənl/个人的/This is my personal opinion.
perspective/pərˈspektɪv/视角/We should look at things from different perspectives.
persuade/pərˈsweɪd/说服/She persuaded him to change his mind.
pet/pet/宠物/She has a pet cat.
phase/feɪz/阶段/The project is in its final phase.
phenomenon/fɪˈnɑːmɪnən/现象/Global warming is a natural phenomenon.
philosophy/fɪˈlɑːsəfi/哲学/He studied philosophy at university.
phone/foʊn/电话/She answered the phone quickly.
photo/ˈfoʊtoʊ/照片/She took a beautiful photo of the sunset.
phrase/freɪz/短语/Can you explain this phrase?
physical/ˈfɪzɪkl/身体的；物理的/Physical exercise is good for health.
physics/ˈfɪzɪks/物理学/She is studying physics at college.
pick/pɪk/挑选/Pick the one you like best.
picture/ˈpɪktʃər/图画；照片/She drew a picture of her family.
piece/piːs/片；件/She cut the cake into eight pieces.
pile/paɪl/堆/There was a pile of books on the desk.
pilot/ˈpaɪlət/飞行员/The pilot landed the plane safely.
pink/pɪŋk/粉色的/She wore a pink dress to the party.
pipe/paɪp/管子/Water flows through the pipe.
place/pleɪs/地方/This is a good place for a picnic.
plain/pleɪn/朴素的；明显的/She wore a plain white shirt.
plan/plæn/计划/What are your plans for the weekend?
plane/pleɪn/飞机/We took a plane to Beijing.
planet/ˈplænɪt/地球/Earth is the third planet from the sun.
plant/plænt/植物；工厂/She planted some flowers in the garden.
plate/pleɪt/盘子/She put the food on a plate.
platform/ˈplætfɔːrm/平台；站台/The train will arrive at platform 3.
play/pleɪ/玩；戏剧/The children are playing in the yard.
pleasant/ˈpleznt/令人愉快的/We had a pleasant conversation.
please/pliːz/请/Please sit down.
pleasure/ˈpleʒər/快乐/It's a pleasure to meet you.
plenty/ˈplenti/充足/There is plenty of time; don't rush.
plot/plɒt/情节；阴谋/The plot of the movie is very exciting.
plug/plʌɡ/插头/Plug the charger into the socket.
plus/plʌs/加；优势/Her experience is a real plus for this job.
pocket/ˈpɑːkɪt/口袋/He put his phone in his pocket.
poem/ˈpoʊɪm/诗/She wrote a beautiful poem.
point/pɔɪnt/点；要点/What is the main point of your argument?
poison/ˈpɔɪzn/毒药/Rat poison should be kept away from children.
police/pəˈliːs/警察/The police are investigating the robbery.
policy/ˈpɑːləsi/政策/The government introduced a new education policy.
polish/ˈpɑːlɪʃ/擦亮；润色/She polished the silver until it shone.
polite/pəˈlaɪt/有礼貌的/It is polite to say "thank you."
political/pəˈlɪtɪkl/政治的/He is very interested in political affairs.
pollution/pəˈluːʃn/污染/Air pollution is a serious problem in many cities.
pool/puːl/水池/They went swimming in the pool.
poor/pʊr/贫穷的；可怜的/The poor child had no food to eat.
popularity/ˌpɑːpjuˈlærəti/流行/The popularity of online shopping is increasing.
population/ˌpɑːpjuˈleɪʃn/人口/The population of the city is over ten million.
port/pɔːrt/港口/The ship arrived at the port this morning.
